# CL2 — Soul Gaze

**Action Type:** Action  
**Range:** 60 feet  
**Cost:** 1 Resonance

Choose one creature you can see. You may instead choose a creature Resonance Marked by you within range even if you cannot see it, provided it is not behind total spiritual concealment.

Learn:

- its current and maximum Hit Points;
- its broad creature nature and cultivation Path, if any;
- whether its effective CL or relevant Source CL is lower than, equal to, or higher than yours;
- its damage resistances, immunities, and vulnerabilities;
- its surface emotional state;
- whether it is affected by an ordinary curse, possession, coercive Hosting, Heart Demon, dream intrusion, memory interference, spiritual contamination, Spirit Scar, or obvious soul injury;
- the broad category of one Spirit Bond, possession link, or Spiritual Anchor currently sustaining an obvious effect upon it.

Soul Gaze does not automatically reveal:

- a protected Soul Anchor;
- a spirit’s complete Nature or Bond contract;
- Secret or divine identity;
- hidden phases or unrevealed transformations;
- exact unspent Cultivation Points;
- protected memories;
- the complete text of an unknown feature;
- a concealed effect whose Source Rule defeats ordinary spiritual diagnosis.

When protected information is contested, make a Cultivation Check against the protecting effect. On failure, identify which category of information was concealed, but not its contents. You cannot retry against the same concealment until it changes, you gain new evidence, or a new scene begins.

---

